# Untrusted folder: Esc also declines (dialog_trust.go's HandleKey "esc"
# case calls answer(false) directly, regardless of cursor position), and
# declining quits the process (internal/tui/app.go's MsgTrustAnswered
# handler: `if !msg.Trusted { return m, tea.Quit }`) — it never reaches
# "describe a task" (corrected from an earlier version of this scenario
# that assumed the dialog just closed and the session continued).
@faux testdata/faux/hello.yaml
@size 120x40
@untrusted

WAITFOR /Accessing workspace/ 20
SHOT trust-dialog-esc
KEY esc
WAIT 1
SHOT trust-esc-closed
NOTE kiln should have exited on esc; nothing further to type
EXPECT_NOT /panic|goroutine/
